<title>USA: Thor Industries says 503,319 shrs tendered.</title>
<headline>Thor Industries says 503,319 shrs tendered.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON CENTER, Ohio 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thor Industries Inc said Friday that 503,319 shares were tendered under a &quot;Dutch Auction.&quot;</p>
<p>The shares were tendered at $24-3/4 per share or lower in an offer that expired Thursday, the company said. Shares tendered in excess of that price are to be returned.</p>
<p>Thor manufactures recreational vehicles and builds small- and medium-sized buses.</p>
</text>
